<title>FINLAND: FINNISH BANKRUPTCY FILINGS FELL TO 299 IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>FINNISH BANKRUPTCY FILINGS FELL TO 299 IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of organisations filing for bankruptcy fell to 299 in April from 327 in March and from 353 in April 1996, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Of the April total, 235 were companies, up from 234 in March but down from 240 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
